      {
        "text": "Information Technology",
        "title": "Critical Infrastructure Sectors",
        "category": "other"
      },
      {
        "text": "BullWall Ransomware Containment and Server Intrusion Protection are products used for ransomware containment. Multiple vulnerabilities were reported that when used individually or in conjunction could allow a remote attacker with valid credentials to log in to a system with BullWall products and bypass ransomware detection. ",
        "title": "Risk Evaluation",
        "category": "summary"
      },
      {
        "text": "Contact BullWall.",
        "title": "Recommended Practices",
        "category": "general"
      },
      {
